# CLAUDE.md is prose documentation read by every agent session, and prettier's
# markdown printer damages it rather than formatting it:
#   * it strips the spaces around an inline-code span that sits between two
#     code terms -- "`a` adds `b`" becomes "`a`adds`b`"
#   * it escapes "__" inside identifiers, so the documented
#     drizzle.__drizzle_migrations becomes drizzle.\_\_drizzle_migrations
# Keeping it out of `pnpm format` / `format:check` is deliberate; the file is
# hand-maintained.
CLAUDE.md

# Local Claude Code harness state (gitignored, never in CI); keeping it out of
# format:check makes the local gate match CI instead of failing on transcripts.
.claude/

# Local superpowers agent scratch (gitignored by .superpowers/sdd/.gitignore,
# never in CI); same reason as .claude/.
.superpowers/
